      "text": "\n/// Product inquiries (generated by the AppCore feature generator).\nmodel ProductInquiry {\n  id        String    @id @default(uuid(7)) @db.Uuid\n  createdAt DateTime  @default(now()) @map(\"created_at\") @db.Timestamptz(3)\n  updatedAt DateTime  @updatedAt @map(\"updated_at\") @db.Timestamptz(3)\n  createdBy String?   @map(\"created_by\") @db.VarChar(64)\n  updatedBy String?   @map(\"updated_by\") @db.VarChar(64)\n  version   Int       @default(1)\n  deletedAt DateTime? @map(\"deleted_at\") @db.Timestamptz(3)\n  deletedBy String?   @map(\"deleted_by\") @db.VarChar(64)\n\n  reference    String @db.VarChar(160) @unique\n  customerName String @db.VarChar(160) @map(\"customer_name\")\n  company      String? @db.VarChar(160)\n  email        String @db.VarChar(160)\n  phone        String? @db.VarChar(160)\n  productSlug  String? @db.VarChar(160) @map(\"product_slug\")\n  inquiryType  String @db.VarChar(160) @map(\"inquiry_type\")\n  message      String @db.VarChar(2000)\n  requirements String? @db.VarChar(2000)\n  contactMethod String @db.VarChar(160) @map(\"contact_method\")\n  source       String? @db.VarChar(160)\n  status       String @db.VarChar(160)\n  assignedTo   String? @db.VarChar(160) @map(\"assigned_to\")\n  respondedAt  DateTime? @db.Timestamptz(3) @map(\"responded_at\")\n\n  @@index([deletedAt])\n  @@map(\"product_inquiries\")\n}\n",
